 $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum1359 (k215PVector u t w c a b 0 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum1385 (k215PVector u b (t, w) c a b 0 0 v)) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage0At1359) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage1At1359) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage2At1359) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage3At1359) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage4At1359) k215PushAStage5At1359)))));

